	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Felix ac faustus sit vobis novus hic annus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Fratres charissimi, unis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>vos literis salutare libuit, quod tempus defuit, quo singulos possem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vesperi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>significatum est <persName ref="p20834">Walderum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p20834">Johann Walder</persName>.</note> ad vos abiturum, ut postridie post prandium ad iter <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>se vellet accingere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Cogito sępe felicitatem ecclesię vestrę, quia, qui praesunt, ade<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>o fovent concordiam, ut ne in leviculis sit aliqua species dissidii.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ex quo tota <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ecclesia sic retinetur in statu felici, ut hunc perturbare vel impiorum vis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et multitudo nequeat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quę hinc commoda, quę piarum mentium tranquillitas, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>qui fructus pietatis, qui literarum proventus, ausim dicere me his <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>temporibus melius nosse quam vos, qui commodis illis fruimini.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In causa est, quod equi<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dem non ita pridem in simili statu positus nunc contrarium pati cogor, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>unde, quę fuerit tunc suavitas vitę et totius fortunę meę et ecclesię, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>in praesens cognosco melius.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Unde nil nisi dolor, gemitus, querimonię, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nulla iucunditas vitę, nulla studiorum, nulla doctrinę, adeo diss<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>idium initio parvulum omnia vastavit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dicam vobis ut intimis meis quidna<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>m.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Flagitia corripere scitis quam res sit in ecclesia, ubi boni et mali, ne<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>cessaria.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Idem officii dum voluimus, ut par erat, uni<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadt</persName>; vgl. bereits <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl> <ref target="file11367">[Nr. 1324]</ref>, S. 243f, 1-27.</note> ex nobis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>imponere, sic restitit, ut clamaret se nolle doceri a nobis.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Deinceps <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>igitur tam diligenter, quod renuit, prosequutus est, quam est natura pronus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad auram populi venandam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Illud itaque mox adsequutus est, ut boni, mitis, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>placidi nomen apud omnes obtineret, ego contra immitis, crudelis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et tantum non tumultuosi, ut cui nihil rectum, nihil planum esset.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Hoc pacto divisus est populus haud aliter, quam solent pueri scholares, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dum hic blandum, alius virgis utentem libentius sequitur praeceptorem.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Iam <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ubi sensit symmista favorem, concursum, laudem ex concionum suarum dulcedine <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>paratam, adeo blanditur, ut crederes iurasse placentia se deinceps <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>dicturum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Hoc quidem initium; quanta vero mala deinde sint <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>exorta, brevibus dici non potest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Partem nosti tu, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, ex me, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>sed ita, ut nescias; partem scitis omnes ex d. <persName ref="p1365">Grynęo</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Siehe <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl>, <ref target="file11375">Nr. 1332</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Verum rem totam adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>scio vos ignorare, nisi ex abbate <placeName ref="l992">Wettingensi</placeName> vetere<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8123">Georg Müller</persName>.</note>, quę acta sunt <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>inter nos et universitatem<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Ob kurz vor der Jahreswende neue Verhandlungen stattgefunden haben, ist nicht bekannt.</note>, acceperitis; nam audio quendam<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Unbekannt.</note> hinc ad <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>eum misisse omnia, etiam quę nos etiamnum ignoramus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Interim tamen et <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ea nescitis, quę subverterunt ecclesiam, nescitis ecclesię speciem, nescitis, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>quod quidam verbum libenter al ligarent<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 2, 9</ref></cit>.</note>, qua de re coram mallem libenti<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>us colloqui, si possem, quam per literas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Ex uno fonte isthęc omnia, et quęcunque <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>mihi displicent, habent illum pro defensore.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Exemplum: Ego superioribus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>diebus discrimen dixi inter potestatem ecclesiasticam et potestatem sęcularem.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Hic inter alia exposui non<pb type="edition" next="26"/> licere, ut officia commisceantur; alioqui futurum, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>quod vidimus in papatu quodque tentarunt catabaptistę.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ille protinus <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>pro suggestu clamat licere senatui praescribere sacerdotibus; nam et reges <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Iuda praescripserint etiam suis sacerdotibus<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Gedacht ist wohl an Josia; vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kön 23, 4</ref></cit>.</note>, non animadvertens illos non praescripsisse, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>sed commendasse, ut agerent secundum legem domini, qualiter nostri magistratus <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>commendant, ut praedicemus evangelium etc.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Ex hoc ungue leonem<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">"An dieser Klaue kannst Du den Löwen erkennen"; zur Redensart vgl. Georg Büchmann, Geflügelte Worte. Der klassische Zitatenschatz, 41. Aufl., bearb. v. Winfried Hofmann, Berlin 1998, S. 292.</note>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Quia vero, quę dicit, ad consilium pertinent senatus, ego succumbo et me-<pb type="scan" next="160v."/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>cum mei omnes.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Inde mutatio synodi, praescriptio excommunicationis et omnium, quę publico <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>decreto adversum nos sunt edita<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Zur Synodal- und Bannordnung vom 19. November 1539 s. <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl>, S. 2791, 1-10 mit Anm. 1.</note>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Frater <persName ref="p1998">Io[annes]</persName> minorita<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p1998">Johannes Lüthard</persName>.</note> de his ad <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>scripsit<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Der Brief ist nicht erhalten.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Videtis malorum fontem, quem libentius indicavi, ut videatis ex<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>emplo, quę iam olim abunde cognovistis.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Intelligentes itaque, quam simus miseri, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>dominum orabitis pro nobis, quęso, et literas Vulcano dedicetis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Valete in domino <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>cum uxoribus<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="13"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>, bzw. <persName ref="p4300">Rosilla, geb. Rordorf</persName>.</note> et liberis<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="14">Von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kindern lebten zu diesem Zeitpunkt <persName ref="p7224">Anna</persName> (geb. 1530), <persName ref="p5608">Margaretha</persName> (1531), <persName ref="p6609">Elisabeth</persName> (1532), <persName ref="p487">Heinrich</persName> (1534), <persName ref="p477">Hans Rudolf</persName> (1536), <persName ref="p475">Christoph</persName> (1537) und <persName ref="p21014">Johannes</persName> (1539); vgl. <bibl source="b483">Pestalozzi</bibl> 314. Zu <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Kindern, über die wenig bekannt ist, vgl. <hi>Egli,</hi> Analecta II 23.</note> vestris.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, raptim, kalendis ianuarii anno 40.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> vester.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>et d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro Biblian<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>dro</persName>, suis in domino.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
